Bundled third-party code
========================

src/vendor/pdfio/
-----------------

This directory vendors the library sources of pdfio, version 1.6.5, from
https://github.com/michaelrsweet/pdfio, including its ttf library (ttf.c,
ttf.h), which ships in the same release. The release, the commit it
resolves to, the tarball checksum, the import date and the local patches
are recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

